      "doc": "The full BB SDK, bound to this server over loopback (design §4.1). Bind-gated: reading this before the host binds the SDK throws. The real server binds it before loading plugins, so it is available from the moment factories run there — but isolated harnesses may not, so prefer using it from handlers, services, and timers for portability. `threads.spawn` and `threads.fork` default `origin` to \"plugin\" and, for that origin, `originPluginId` to this plugin's id unless you set them. Seeding `pluginMetadata` always attributes the new thread to this plugin, overriding an explicit `origin` or `originPluginId`.",
